1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,970
史上最强的厄尔尼诺，
The strongest El Niño on record

2
00:00:01,970 --> 00:00:04,100
正在太平洋上“充满电”。
is charging up over the Pacific.

3
00:00:04,100 --> 00:00:06,770
可气象局说：今冬总体偏暖，
Yet forecasters say this winter will be warmer overall,

4
00:00:06,770 --> 00:00:08,330
寒潮却略偏多。
with slightly more cold waves.

5
00:00:08,330 --> 00:00:09,260
又暖又冷？
Warm and cold?

6
00:00:09,260 --> 00:00:11,430
这预报是不是自相矛盾？
Is the forecast contradicting itself?

7
00:00:11,430 --> 00:00:14,380
十一月三日，中国气象局开发布会，
On November third, the China Meteorological Administration held a briefing,

8
00:00:14,380 --> 00:00:16,150
这条冲上了热点榜。
and it hit the trending lists.

9
00:00:16,150 --> 00:00:18,420
他们说，这次是有监测记录以来
They said this is the strongest El Niño

10
00:00:18,420 --> 00:00:19,840
最强的厄尔尼诺。
since records began.

11
00:00:19,840 --> 00:00:21,110
今天的烧脑问题：
Today's brain teaser:

12
00:00:21,110 --> 00:00:23,610
暖冬来了，为啥羽绒服还不能收？
if it's a warm winter, why keep the down jacket?

13
00:00:23,610 --> 00:00:26,250
先认识主角：一滴热海水，
Meet our hero: a drop of warm sea water,

14
00:00:26,250 --> 00:00:27,030
小尼。
Little Niño.

15
00:00:27,030 --> 00:00:28,580
厄尔尼诺是西班牙语，
El Niño is Spanish

16
00:00:28,580 --> 00:00:30,100
意思是“小男孩”。
for 'the little boy'.

17
00:00:30,100 --> 00:00:32,160
秘鲁渔民发现，每隔几年，
Peruvian fishermen noticed that every few years,

18
00:00:32,160 --> 00:00:34,680
圣诞前后海水变暖，鱼也少了。
the sea warmed around Christmas and the fish vanished.

19
00:00:34,680 --> 00:00:36,360
平时，太平洋上的信风
Normally, the trade winds

20
00:00:36,360 --> 00:00:37,490
从东往西吹。
blow across the Pacific from east to west.

21
00:00:37,490 --> 00:00:38,780
信风把表层的热水
They push the warm surface water

22
00:00:38,780 --> 00:00:40,830
一路推到印度尼西亚那边。
all the way toward Indonesia.

23
00:00:40,830 --> 00:00:41,900
西边的海面，
So the sea surface in the west

24
00:00:41,900 --> 00:00:43,810
比东边高出大约半米。
sits about half a meter higher than in the east.

25
00:00:43,810 --> 00:00:45,210
东边秘鲁那头，
Off Peru in the east,

26
00:00:45,210 --> 00:00:47,930
深海冷水翻上来，鱼特别多。
cold deep water wells up, and fish thrive.

27
00:00:47,930 --> 00:00:49,470
反转一：信风一松劲，
Twist one: when the trade winds weaken,

28
00:00:49,470 --> 00:00:51,430
热水就“哗”地流回东边。
the warm water sloshes back east.

29
00:00:51,430 --> 00:00:52,860
就像澡盆里的水，
Like water in a bathtub:

30
00:00:52,860 --> 00:00:54,940
你一松手，水就往回晃。
let go, and it sloshes back.

31
00:00:54,940 --> 00:00:56,600
于是大半个赤道太平洋
So a huge stretch of the equatorial Pacific

32
00:00:56,600 --> 00:00:57,710
都热了起来。
heats up.

33
00:00:57,710 --> 00:00:58,940
太平洋有多大？
How big is the Pacific?

34
00:00:58,940 --> 00:01:01,170
占了地球表面的三分之一。
About a third of Earth's surface.

35
00:01:01,170 --> 00:01:03,670
反转二：海水是个超级充电宝。
Twist two: the ocean is a giant power bank.

36
00:01:03,670 --> 00:01:07,360
海面下几米的水，存的热就顶得上整个大气。
The top few meters hold as much heat as the whole atmosphere.

37
00:01:07,360 --> 00:01:10,360
今年只用了大约五个月，就冲到超强；
This year it went super strong in about five months.

38
00:01:10,360 --> 00:01:12,250
以前要八到十五个月。
Before, it took eight to fifteen.

39
00:01:12,250 --> 00:01:13,830
国家气候中心说，
China's National Climate Center says

40
00:01:13,830 --> 00:01:15,930
峰值大概在秋末冬初。
it should peak in late autumn or early winter.

41
00:01:15,930 --> 00:01:17,700
充满了电，就要放电：
Once charged, it discharges:

42
00:01:17,700 --> 00:01:19,600
热量一点点送进大气。
heat seeps into the air, bit by bit.

43
00:01:19,600 --> 00:01:21,220
大气的环流一改道，
When the air currents shift,

44
00:01:21,220 --> 00:01:23,150
全球的天气都被搅动。
weather all over the world gets stirred.

45
00:01:23,150 --> 00:01:24,990
这股劲能拖大约半年，
The effect can last about half a year,

46
00:01:24,990 --> 00:01:26,580
一直到明年春天。
into next spring.

47
00:01:26,580 --> 00:01:28,830
对我们：全国气温总体偏高，
For China: temperatures mostly above normal,

48
00:01:28,830 --> 00:01:30,690
南方的雨雪显著偏多。
and much more rain and snow in the south.

49
00:01:30,690 --> 00:01:32,250
反转三，最反直觉：
Twist three, the most counterintuitive:

50
00:01:32,250 --> 00:01:34,110
偏暖，不等于天天暖。
warmer does not mean warm every day.

51
00:01:34,110 --> 00:01:36,210
气象局说：寒潮略偏多，
Forecasters say: slightly more cold waves,

52
00:01:36,210 --> 00:01:38,610
冷暖起伏大，像坐过山车。
big swings, like a roller coaster.

53
00:01:38,610 --> 00:01:41,130
打个比方：一周里三天零下五度，
Picture a week with three days at minus five,

54
00:01:41,130 --> 00:01:42,260
四天十五度。
and four days at fifteen.

55
00:01:42,260 --> 00:01:44,370
平均一算，六度多，挺暖；
Average it out: over six degrees, not bad.

56
00:01:44,370 --> 00:01:46,600
可那三天，你冻得直哆嗦。
But on those three days, you shiver.

57
00:01:46,600 --> 00:01:48,000
平均数会骗人，
Averages can fool you.

58
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:49,710
起伏才是要命的。
The swings are what bite.

59
00:01:49,710 --> 00:01:51,980
预报还说“前冬冷、后冬暖”，
The forecast also says: colder early, warmer late,

60
00:01:51,980 --> 00:01:54,360
十二月、一月忽冷忽热最频繁。
with the wildest swings in December and January.

61
00:01:54,360 --> 00:01:56,280
北方要防强降温和大雪，
The north should watch for cold snaps and heavy snow,

62
00:01:56,280 --> 00:01:58,320
南方要防低温雨雪冰冻。
the south for freezing rain and ice.

63
00:01:58,320 --> 00:02:00,420
内蒙古东北部和东北西部，
Northeast Inner Mongolia and western Northeast China

64
00:02:00,420 --> 00:02:02,110
还可能比常年偏冷。
may even run colder than usual.

65
00:02:02,110 --> 00:02:05,300
友情提示：这是季节预测，说的是可能性，
Fine print: this is a seasonal forecast, about odds,

66
00:02:05,300 --> 00:02:07,090
不是说哪一天一定冷。
not a promise about any single day.

67
00:02:07,090 --> 00:02:09,760
专家也说：每次厄尔尼诺背景不同，
Experts also say every El Niño is different,

68
00:02:09,760 --> 00:02:11,380
影响不会简单照抄。
so the effects never simply repeat.

69
00:02:11,380 --> 00:02:13,540
所以，暖冬为啥寒潮反而多？
So why more cold waves in a warm winter?

70
00:02:13,540 --> 00:02:15,810
因为平均暖了，起伏却更大。
The average rises, but the swings get bigger.

71
00:02:15,810 --> 00:02:16,970
秋裤先别收，
Keep your long johns handy.

72
00:02:16,970 --> 00:02:19,450
小尼的电，才刚开始放。
Little Niño has only just started to discharge.

